1
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:16,790
<font color="#FFFFFF">Who're they?</font>

2
00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:18,320
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, that's...</font>

3
00:00:18,920 --> 00:00:21,190
<font color="#FFFFFF">Granny Chiyo... and Ebizo.</font>

4
00:00:21,490 --> 00:00:24,490
<font color="#FFFFFF">No way. I thought they were supposed
to have long since been retired.</font>

5
00:00:29,550 --> 00:00:31,120
<font color="#FFFFFF">Treatment Room 3</font>

6
00:00:36,390 --> 00:00:38,420
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, we have been expecting you.</font>

7
00:00:38,650 --> 00:00:40,490
<font color="#FFFFFF">Please enter.</font>

8
00:00:41,320 --> 00:00:43,090
<font color="#FFFFFF">I think you all know who
these people are.</font>

9
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:44,920
<font color="#FFFFFF">This is Lady Chiyo and Lord Ebizo.</font>

10
00:00:45,250 --> 00:00:46,050
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Hello.
- Welcome.</font>

11
00:00:49,790 --> 00:00:52,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hm? If I'm not mistaken, this is...</font>

12
00:00:53,150 --> 00:00:54,250
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's Kankuro.</font>

13
00:00:54,390 --> 00:00:56,550
<font color="#FFFFFF">The current Kazekage's older brother.</font>

14
00:00:57,050 --> 00:00:59,090
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, that's right.</font>

15
00:01:04,120 --> 00:01:06,250
<font color="#FFFFFF">You checked his blood, right?</font>

16
00:01:06,420 --> 00:01:08,320
<font color="#FFFFFF">Y-Yes. Please look at this.</font>

17
00:01:11,650 --> 00:01:14,920
<font color="#FFFFFF">I've never seen...
composition like this before.</font>

18
00:01:15,190 --> 00:01:17,690
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes. We believe it might be
a new type of poison.</font>

19
00:01:18,220 --> 00:01:20,390
<font color="#FFFFFF">Have you tried an antidote?</font>

20
00:01:20,850 --> 00:01:22,550
<font color="#FFFFFF">For the time being,
we tried using what we had.</font>

21
00:01:23,090 --> 00:01:25,490
<font color="#FFFFFF">But none had any identifiable effects.</font>

22
00:01:26,390 --> 00:01:27,450
<font color="#FFFFFF">I see...</font>

23
00:01:27,990 --> 00:01:32,020
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ordinarily, he would just finish the job...</font>

24
00:01:32,720 --> 00:01:36,290
<font color="#FFFFFF">It appears he's very confident
about his poison.</font>

25
00:01:36,890 --> 00:01:41,490
<font color="#FFFFFF">Leaving his prey as is
on purpose is just like Sasori.</font>

26
00:01:57,720 --> 00:02:00,050
<font color="#FFFFFF">Finally we're out of the Sand.</font>

27
00:02:04,050 --> 00:02:07,920
<font color="#FFFFFF">I hate making people wait...
Let's hurry.</font>

28
00:02:08,190 --> 00:02:12,850
<font color="#FFFFFF">Good grief. Whose fault was it
that it took this long?</font>

29
00:02:13,150 --> 00:02:15,190
<font color="#FFFFFF">That goes for both of us.</font>

30
00:02:15,420 --> 00:02:16,420
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh yeah.</font>

31
00:03:50,690 --> 00:03:55,190
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sealing Jutsu:
Nine Phantom Dragons</font>

32
00:04:04,390 --> 00:04:05,620
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right.</font>

33
00:04:12,690 --> 00:04:14,520
<font color="#FFFFFF">This one didn't work, either.</font>

34
00:04:15,190 --> 00:04:18,250
<font color="#FFFFFF">You haven't tried anything else?</font>

35
00:04:18,420 --> 00:04:19,790
<font color="#FFFFFF">For the time being,</font>

36
00:04:19,820 --> 00:04:22,950
<font color="#FFFFFF">we have requested the Leaf for
a specialist team to be dispatched.</font>

37
00:04:23,420 --> 00:04:25,590
<font color="#FFFFFF">It would be best to wait for their arrival.</font>

38
00:04:26,990 --> 00:04:29,250
<font color="#FFFFFF">Talk about depending on others.</font>

39
00:04:30,020 --> 00:04:32,920
<font color="#FFFFFF">This happened because you depend
on alliances with other lands</font>

40
00:04:32,950 --> 00:04:36,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">and conduct nothing
but slipshod education.</font>

41
00:04:37,050 --> 00:04:40,150
<font color="#FFFFFF">It is not... our intention to
depend on others.</font>

42
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:43,020
<font color="#FFFFFF">I guess it can't be helped...</font>

43
00:04:43,050 --> 00:04:47,490
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's his fault for losing his cool
and pursuing too far.</font>

44
00:04:48,050 --> 00:04:50,350
<font color="#FFFFFF">A Shinobi is the last person
who should do that ...</font>

45
00:04:53,620 --> 00:04:55,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">What's the point of trusting
and being totally dependent</font>

46
00:04:55,750 --> 00:04:57,420
<font color="#FFFFFF">on the likes of the Leaf?</font>

47
00:04:57,750 --> 00:05:01,620
<font color="#FFFFFF">Improving the strength of your own village
should be your top priority.</font>

48
00:05:02,590 --> 00:05:05,120
<font color="#FFFFFF">They are them, we are us.</font>

49
00:05:05,890 --> 00:05:09,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">Listen. An amicable alliance is nothing
but a pipe dream.</font>

50
00:05:10,950 --> 00:05:13,390
<font color="#FFFFFF">At times like this,
the most we can expect</font>

51
00:05:13,420 --> 00:05:17,590
<font color="#FFFFFF">is for them to send us some
useless underlings for form's sake.</font>

52
00:05:17,920 --> 00:05:20,520
<font color="#FFFFFF">That would never happen...</font>

53
00:05:20,720 --> 00:05:22,620
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's how it goes.</font>

54
00:05:22,650 --> 00:05:26,350
<font color="#FFFFFF">Everyone looks out for themselves.</font>

55
00:05:33,120 --> 00:05:34,920
<font color="#FFFFFF">Okay, break's over.</font>

56
00:05:36,350 --> 00:05:39,650
<font color="#FFFFFF">Huh? Kakashi Sensei, where's Naruto?</font>

57
00:05:40,220 --> 00:05:41,320
<font color="#FFFFFF">Up there.</font>

58
00:05:56,520 --> 00:05:58,650
<font color="#FFFFFF">One more day until
we get to the Sand.</font>

59
00:05:59,890 --> 00:06:01,320
<font color="#FFFFFF">We have to hurry.</font>

60
00:06:07,250 --> 00:06:08,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">Okay, let's get going.</font>

61
00:06:18,190 --> 00:06:19,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">This is not good.</font>

62
00:06:21,090 --> 00:06:25,320
<font color="#FFFFFF">Poisons are my specialty,
but even I can't figure this out.</font>

63
00:06:25,790 --> 00:06:26,990
<font color="#FFFFFF">Even you, Lady Chiyo...?</font>

64
00:06:27,020 --> 00:06:29,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">At best, he has one day...</font>

65
00:06:29,650 --> 00:06:34,490
<font color="#FFFFFF">He may not even make it
to dawn tomorrow, I'd say.</font>

66
00:06:35,050 --> 00:06:40,090
<font color="#FFFFFF">That Sasori has sure grown considerably.</font>

67
00:06:40,590 --> 00:06:41,990
<font color="#FFFFFF">What in the world should we do?</font>

68
00:06:42,350 --> 00:06:46,250
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well, the only one who might
know more about antidotes than me</font>

69
00:06:46,290 --> 00:06:49,290
<font color="#FFFFFF">would be
the Leaf's slug princess, Tsunade.</font>

70
00:06:50,190 --> 00:06:53,190
<font color="#FFFFFF">I had a lot of trouble with her
during the great war.</font>

71
00:06:53,220 --> 00:06:57,850
<font color="#FFFFFF">She would decipher all the poisons
I created and concoct antidotes.</font>

72
00:06:58,420 --> 00:07:01,090
<font color="#FFFFFF">And now we're allies with the Leaf.</font>

73
00:07:01,390 --> 00:07:05,390
<font color="#FFFFFF">All we can do is send for her and
have her look at Kankuro.</font>

74
00:07:05,620 --> 00:07:08,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">But she is now the Hokage</font>

75
00:07:08,750 --> 00:07:12,120
<font color="#FFFFFF">and would not be able to
leave her village so easily.</font>

76
00:07:12,490 --> 00:07:15,820
<font color="#FFFFFF">And even if she were to come,</font>

77
00:07:15,850 --> 00:07:18,350
<font color="#FFFFFF">it takes three days to get here
from the Leaf.</font>

78
00:07:18,420 --> 00:07:23,890
<font color="#FFFFFF">I know. Nobody's seriously thinking
of summoning her.</font>

79
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:28,620
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't like that slug girl, anyway.</font>

80
00:07:33,390 --> 00:07:35,520
<font color="#FFFFFF">Are you okay, Lady Tsunade?</font>

81
00:07:36,050 --> 00:07:36,950
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah.</font>

82
00:07:37,420 --> 00:07:40,990
<font color="#FFFFFF">There's a cold going around,
so please take care.</font>

83
00:07:41,490 --> 00:07:42,420
<font color="#FFFFFF">Thanks.</font>

84
00:07:50,750 --> 00:07:53,320
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's been two days
since Team Kakashi left.</font>

85
00:07:53,350 --> 00:07:56,120
<font color="#FFFFFF">They should be arriving
tomorrow morning.</font>

86
00:08:00,190 --> 00:08:01,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">This is a bad sign.</font>

87
00:08:02,820 --> 00:08:03,750
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't tell me...!</font>

88
00:08:08,250 --> 00:08:12,690
<font color="#FFFFFF">Group 3, 117037... I knew it.</font>

89
00:08:12,920 --> 00:08:15,920
<font color="#FFFFFF">I won. And first prize at that.</font>

90
00:08:16,350 --> 00:08:18,520
<font color="#FFFFFF">This is really a bad omen.</font>

91
00:08:19,790 --> 00:08:22,050
<font color="#FFFFFF">Shizune. Are you there, Shizune?</font>

92
00:08:24,390 --> 00:08:25,250
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right!</font>

93
00:08:27,050 --> 00:08:28,150
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's the desert!</font>

94
00:08:30,590 --> 00:08:32,920
<font color="#FFFFFF">The Village Hidden in the Sand
is up ahead.</font>

95
00:08:33,950 --> 00:08:36,190
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll take the lead from here.</font>

96
00:08:36,550 --> 00:08:37,490
<font color="#FFFFFF">We're counting on you.</font>

97
00:08:49,120 --> 00:08:50,190
<font color="#FFFFFF">We're here.</font>

98
00:08:54,190 --> 00:08:55,320
<font color="#FFFFFF">Let's go.</font>

99
00:09:45,950 --> 00:09:49,420
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're late. Prepare immediately.</font>

100
00:09:50,190 --> 00:09:54,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">The Jinchuriki was unexpectedly strong.</font>

101
00:10:58,020 --> 00:11:00,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right, gather.</font>

102
00:11:08,750 --> 00:11:11,350
<font color="#FFFFFF">Now, let us begin.</font>

103
00:11:25,850 --> 00:11:29,120
<font color="#FFFFFF">We will soon be done removing the traps
and rocks from the road.</font>

104
00:11:29,390 --> 00:11:30,350
<font color="#FFFFFF">Good work.</font>

105
00:11:30,520 --> 00:11:33,550
<font color="#FFFFFF">We are currently working on
gathering the bodies.</font>

106
00:11:33,750 --> 00:11:35,450
<font color="#FFFFFF">But there is one thing that is
a matter of concern.</font>

107
00:11:35,620 --> 00:11:36,490
<font color="#FFFFFF">What is it?</font>

108
00:11:36,750 --> 00:11:39,090
<font color="#FFFFFF">We have not yet found Captain Yura.</font>

109
00:11:39,420 --> 00:11:40,320
<font color="#FFFFFF">What?</font>

110
00:11:40,890 --> 00:11:43,550
<font color="#FFFFFF">It is clear that the Captain was
heading for the road</font>

111
00:11:43,590 --> 00:11:44,850
<font color="#FFFFFF">before the incident.</font>

112
00:11:45,690 --> 00:11:47,790
<font color="#FFFFFF">We have not even found
a scrap of his clothing,</font>

113
00:11:47,820 --> 00:11:48,790
<font color="#FFFFFF">let alone his body.</font>

114
00:11:49,250 --> 00:11:50,590
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's strange.</font>

115
00:11:51,190 --> 00:11:55,320
<font color="#FFFFFF">He's either slipped past the enemy
and is in pursuit,</font>

116
00:11:55,350 --> 00:11:57,850
<font color="#FFFFFF">or perhaps nobody noticed
that he was killed.</font>

117
00:11:58,620 --> 00:12:01,450
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'd like to send backup for him
if he's still alive.</font>

118
00:12:02,220 --> 00:12:04,150
<font color="#FFFFFF">But if we don't know where he is...</font>

119
00:12:06,220 --> 00:12:08,490
<font color="#FFFFFF">Did you call me, Lady Tsunade?</font>

120
00:12:09,020 --> 00:12:09,890
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes...</font>

121
00:12:10,650 --> 00:12:13,490
<font color="#FFFFFF">I want to send reinforcements to
the Village Hidden in the Sand.</font>

122
00:12:13,920 --> 00:12:15,050
<font color="#FFFFFF">Reinforcements?</font>

123
00:12:15,590 --> 00:12:18,390
<font color="#FFFFFF">They should be about done
with their previous mission</font>

124
00:12:18,420 --> 00:12:19,850
<font color="#FFFFFF">and on their way back by now.</font>

125
00:12:20,850 --> 00:12:21,920
<font color="#FFFFFF">Them?</font>

126
00:12:22,420 --> 00:12:24,990
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh. Yes, ma'am. I'll make
the preparations immediately.</font>

127
00:12:28,650 --> 00:12:31,090
<font color="#FFFFFF">Can the worst-case scenario
be considered?</font>

128
00:12:44,550 --> 00:12:46,850
<font color="#FFFFFF">From now, it will take three days
and three nights.</font>

129
00:12:46,890 --> 00:12:49,620
<font color="#FFFFFF">Keep your attention to
your real body as well.</font>

130
00:12:50,550 --> 00:12:54,590
<font color="#FFFFFF">And Zetsu, you keep watch on the outside
with the body for the time being.</font>

131
00:12:54,890 --> 00:12:57,250
<font color="#FFFFFF">Use the longest range.</font>

132
00:12:57,820 --> 00:12:59,190
<font color="#FFFFFF">I know.</font>

133
00:12:59,920 --> 00:13:01,890
<font color="#FFFFFF">Three days?</font>

134
00:13:02,190 --> 00:13:05,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">Shouldn't we consider that it might
take a bit longer</font>

135
00:13:05,250 --> 00:13:07,620
<font color="#FFFFFF">since we don't have Orochimaru?</font>

136
00:13:07,950 --> 00:13:10,850
<font color="#FFFFFF">If that's what you think,
then get right to it.</font>

137
00:13:11,750 --> 00:13:13,050
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's true.</font>

138
00:13:13,750 --> 00:13:14,820
<font color="#FFFFFF">Indeed.</font>

139
00:13:15,390 --> 00:13:16,490
<font color="#FFFFFF">That sounds good.</font>

140
00:13:26,950 --> 00:13:28,750
<font color="#FFFFFF">Spirit</font>

141
00:13:32,190 --> 00:13:33,450
<font color="#FFFFFF">Blue</font>

142
00:13:34,490 --> 00:13:35,750
<font color="#FFFFFF">White</font>

143
00:13:37,590 --> 00:13:39,090
<font color="#FFFFFF">Red</font>

144
00:13:40,620 --> 00:13:41,920
<font color="#FFFFFF">Boar</font>

145
00:13:43,350 --> 00:13:44,620
<font color="#FFFFFF">South</font>

146
00:13:45,890 --> 00:13:47,450
<font color="#FFFFFF">North</font>

147
00:13:49,050 --> 00:13:50,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">Three</font>

148
00:13:51,850 --> 00:13:53,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sphere</font>

149
00:14:02,650 --> 00:14:05,850
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sealing Jutsu: Nine Phantom Dragons.</font>

150
00:14:27,720 --> 00:14:28,950
<font color="#FFFFFF">Lady Tsunade.</font>

151
00:14:28,990 --> 00:14:31,320
<font color="#FFFFFF">They have returned from their mission!</font>

152
00:14:31,750 --> 00:14:32,850
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right.</font>

153
00:14:36,220 --> 00:14:37,490
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, just a minute, Lady Tsunade.</font>

154
00:14:37,720 --> 00:14:39,950
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm giving you guys
an S-rank mission!</font>

155
00:14:41,590 --> 00:14:43,250
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Huh?
- No way.</font>

156
00:14:44,390 --> 00:14:45,750
<font color="#FFFFFF">S-rank?</font>

157
00:14:45,790 --> 00:14:47,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Mission?
- Don't tell me...</font>

158
00:14:47,950 --> 00:14:50,320
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right! We got an S-rank mission!</font>

159
00:14:50,390 --> 00:14:51,650
<font color="#FFFFFF">I can't believe it...</font>

160
00:14:51,750 --> 00:14:55,050
<font color="#FFFFFF">Our ability has finally
been acknowledged!</font>

161
00:14:55,350 --> 00:14:57,020
<font color="#FFFFFF">I-It can't be!</font>

162
00:14:58,320 --> 00:15:00,350
<font color="#FFFFFF">Are you okay, Ebisu Sensei?</font>

163
00:15:00,420 --> 00:15:03,890
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well, I spent a bit too long soaking
in the hot spring, you see.</font>

164
00:15:04,150 --> 00:15:06,750
<font color="#FFFFFF">More like you were peeping.</font>

165
00:15:07,190 --> 00:15:10,450
<font color="#FFFFFF">Here this is the first S-rank mission
for us since we became Ninja.</font>

166
00:15:10,490 --> 00:15:13,190
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't be catching a cold,
you closet pervert!</font>

167
00:15:14,050 --> 00:15:15,420
<font color="#FFFFFF">What's with these guys?</font>

168
00:15:15,590 --> 00:15:18,120
<font color="#FFFFFF">This is the wrong room, Lady Tsunade.
They're over here.</font>

169
00:15:18,290 --> 00:15:19,850
<font color="#FFFFFF">Geez, how confusing.</font>

170
00:15:21,650 --> 00:15:23,890
<font color="#FFFFFF">What about our S-rank mission?</font>

171
00:15:23,920 --> 00:15:27,150
<font color="#FFFFFF">It was a misunderstanding...
Thank goodness.</font>

172
00:15:30,150 --> 00:15:33,520
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm giving you guys the same mission
as Team Kakashi.</font>

173
00:15:34,120 --> 00:15:36,390
<font color="#FFFFFF">Head for the Sand and
complete the mission</font>

174
00:15:36,420 --> 00:15:38,090
<font color="#FFFFFF">by providing backup for Kakashi
and the others.</font>

175
00:15:38,120 --> 00:15:39,050
<font color="#FFFFFF">Got it?</font>

176
00:15:40,120 --> 00:15:41,090
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes, ma'am!</font>

177
00:15:42,450 --> 00:15:43,650
<font color="#FFFFFF">Please leave it to us.</font>

178
00:15:44,720 --> 00:15:45,720
<font color="#FFFFFF">Roger.</font>

179
00:15:46,820 --> 00:15:47,690
<font color="#FFFFFF">Understood.</font>

180
00:15:48,120 --> 00:15:48,920
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right!</font>

181
00:15:49,450 --> 00:15:51,290
<font color="#FFFFFF">Team Guy heading into action.</font>

182
00:15:54,820 --> 00:15:55,520
<font color="#FFFFFF">You catch a cold?</font>

183
00:15:55,550 --> 00:15:58,650
<font color="#FFFFFF">No, my hay fever started
acting up before...</font>

184
00:16:01,390 --> 00:16:04,520
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right, we'll make it to
the Sand in one day.</font>

185
00:16:04,620 --> 00:16:06,790
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sensei, let's make it in half a day.</font>

186
00:16:07,520 --> 00:16:10,150
<font color="#FFFFFF">It'll take three days, no matter
how you consider it.</font>

187
00:16:10,350 --> 00:16:13,890
<font color="#FFFFFF">Please stop your conversations
with that carried-away mood...</font>

188
00:16:14,020 --> 00:16:15,750
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right, we're leaving!</font>

189
00:16:15,790 --> 00:16:18,490
<font color="#FFFFFF">Together with me, everyone.
The dash of youth!</font>

190
00:16:18,790 --> 00:16:20,120
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes, Guy Sensei!</font>

191
00:16:20,150 --> 00:16:21,850
<font color="#FFFFFF">How embarrassing.</font>

192
00:16:22,020 --> 00:16:23,890
<font color="#FFFFFF">Give it up, Tenten.</font>

193
00:16:24,590 --> 00:16:27,050
<font color="#FFFFFF">They're as energetic as ever.</font>

194
00:16:33,050 --> 00:16:35,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's sure been awhile
since we've seen Naruto.</font>

195
00:16:35,450 --> 00:16:37,920
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm looking forward to seeing
how much he's grown.</font>

196
00:16:38,390 --> 00:16:39,320
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah.</font>

197
00:16:49,950 --> 00:16:52,520
<font color="#FFFFFF">Here we're so close to
the Village Hidden in the Sand...</font>

198
00:16:52,550 --> 00:16:54,350
<font color="#FFFFFF">I can't just sit around waiting!</font>

199
00:16:54,450 --> 00:16:57,790
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto, I told you not to
lose your patience.</font>

200
00:16:57,990 --> 00:16:59,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">But...!</font>

201
00:16:59,590 --> 00:17:03,490
<font color="#FFFFFF">Be patient. Right now, Temari is
the one who's the most anxious.</font>

202
00:17:04,420 --> 00:17:06,390
<font color="#FFFFFF">The ironclad rule is to
stay put right there</font>

203
00:17:06,420 --> 00:17:08,290
<font color="#FFFFFF">if you encounter a sandstorm.</font>

204
00:17:09,250 --> 00:17:11,890
<font color="#FFFFFF">You lose your sense of direction
in a sandstorm.</font>

205
00:17:12,750 --> 00:17:14,320
<font color="#FFFFFF">We often hear of people</font>

206
00:17:14,350 --> 00:17:17,050
<font color="#FFFFFF">dying of dehydration after
getting lost in the desert.</font>

207
00:17:18,420 --> 00:17:19,350
<font color="#FFFFFF">It'll be okay.</font>

208
00:17:19,850 --> 00:17:22,920
<font color="#FFFFFF">A sandstorm around this time
of year shouldn't last too long.</font>

209
00:17:25,420 --> 00:17:26,890
<font color="#FFFFFF">Please let up soon.</font>

210
00:17:32,490 --> 00:17:33,750
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kankuro...</font>

211
00:17:34,650 --> 00:17:35,690
<font color="#FFFFFF">Give him a sedative.</font>

212
00:17:35,750 --> 00:17:36,490
<font color="#FFFFFF">Okay.</font>

213
00:17:43,050 --> 00:17:46,650
<font color="#FFFFFF">All we can do now is ease his pain...</font>

214
00:17:47,620 --> 00:17:52,090
<font color="#FFFFFF">Our only ray of hope is the Leaf Shinobi
who are scheduled to arrive tomorrow.</font>

215
00:17:53,950 --> 00:17:56,850
<font color="#FFFFFF">If they have a poison specialist
with them...</font>

216
00:17:57,320 --> 00:18:01,120
<font color="#FFFFFF">If Kankuro can hold on
that long, of course.</font>

217
00:18:01,920 --> 00:18:05,950
<font color="#FFFFFF">The road from the Leaf is currently
impassable due to a sandstorm.</font>

218
00:18:06,520 --> 00:18:09,490
<font color="#FFFFFF">In the worst case,
they could arrive several days late.</font>

219
00:18:09,990 --> 00:18:12,220
<font color="#FFFFFF">If that happens,
then it's hopeless.</font>

220
00:18:12,620 --> 00:18:14,690
<font color="#FFFFFF">This is pathetic...</font>

221
00:18:14,850 --> 00:18:19,450
<font color="#FFFFFF">I can't believe the day has come when
we have to rely on the aid of the Leaf.</font>

222
00:18:20,020 --> 00:18:24,090
<font color="#FFFFFF">Aren't you tired, Big Sister?
Let's have a seat outside.</font>

223
00:18:24,890 --> 00:18:27,990
<font color="#FFFFFF">You haven't had a wink of
sleep since yesterday, right?</font>

224
00:18:29,250 --> 00:18:32,820
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's so sad,
having to depend on the Leaf...</font>

225
00:18:38,020 --> 00:18:39,020
<font color="#FFFFFF">Big Sister.</font>

226
00:18:44,820 --> 00:18:45,890
<font color="#FFFFFF">She fell asleep, huh?</font>

227
00:18:54,390 --> 00:18:57,390
<font color="#FFFFFF">If they're early, the help from the Leaf
should be arriving pretty soon.</font>

228
00:18:57,950 --> 00:19:00,620
<font color="#FFFFFF">But even a local wouldn't be
able to get here quickly</font>

229
00:19:00,650 --> 00:19:02,290
<font color="#FFFFFF">with yesterday's sandstorm.</font>

230
00:19:03,820 --> 00:19:05,250
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey, what's that?</font>

231
00:19:07,890 --> 00:19:08,750
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh!</font>

232
00:19:13,150 --> 00:19:14,420
<font color="#FFFFFF">We've been expecting you.</font>

233
00:19:14,950 --> 00:19:16,420
<font color="#FFFFFF">So you were with them, Temari?</font>

234
00:19:16,890 --> 00:19:18,150
<font color="#FFFFFF">Please, come this way.</font>

235
00:19:23,220 --> 00:19:25,690
<font color="#FFFFFF">What? They got Kankuro, too?</font>

236
00:19:25,890 --> 00:19:30,620
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes, Lord Kazekage was taken and
Kankuro followed in pursuit.</font>

237
00:19:31,290 --> 00:19:34,620
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kankuro was poisoned by the enemy
and we don't know how to neutralize it.</font>

238
00:19:34,690 --> 00:19:36,520
<font color="#FFFFFF">At this rate... he won't...</font>

239
00:19:38,690 --> 00:19:39,650
<font color="#FFFFFF">Damn it!</font>

240
00:19:40,620 --> 00:19:42,190
<font color="#FFFFFF">Let's hurry, Temari.</font>

241
00:19:43,090 --> 00:19:44,290
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll take a look at him.</font>

242
00:19:44,520 --> 00:19:46,290
<font color="#FFFFFF">Treatment Room 3</font>

243
00:19:46,890 --> 00:19:47,750
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kankuro!</font>

244
00:19:49,890 --> 00:19:50,550
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kankuro!</font>

245
00:19:52,590 --> 00:19:55,690
<font color="#FFFFFF">He's... the White Fang of the Leaf!</font>

246
00:19:56,090 --> 00:19:57,820
<font color="#FFFFFF">You jerk!</font>

247
00:20:00,750 --> 00:20:01,520
<font color="#FFFFFF">Huh?</font>

248
00:20:01,550 --> 00:20:03,920
<font color="#FFFFFF">Prepare yourself!</font>

249
00:21:34,950 --> 00:21:36,420
<font color="#FFFFFF">Medical Emergency 24 hours.</font>

250
00:21:36,450 --> 00:21:38,920
<font color="#FFFFFF">Today we're reporting live from
the Hidden Sand Medical Facility.</font>

251
00:21:39,490 --> 00:21:41,790
<font color="#FFFFFF">It appears that a new patient
has been brought in just now.</font>

252
00:21:41,820 --> 00:21:45,050
<font color="#FFFFFF">The patient is a 17-year-old Jonin,
poisoned, and in critical condition.</font>

253
00:21:45,090 --> 00:21:46,950
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, his Kumadori make up
is being washed off!</font>

254
00:21:47,920 --> 00:21:49,620
<font color="#FFFFFF">The surgeon seems to be a girl.</font>

255
00:21:49,650 --> 00:21:51,620
<font color="#FFFFFF">Can such a young doctor handle this?</font>

256
00:21:51,750 --> 00:21:54,350
<font color="#FFFFFF">It looks like the toxin is
being sucked out... however!</font>

257
00:21:56,650 --> 00:21:58,550
<font color="#FFFFFF">Despite their medical efforts,</font>

258
00:21:58,590 --> 00:22:00,090
<font color="#FFFFFF">it appears they have just
lost the patient.</font>

259
00:22:00,120 --> 00:22:01,190
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey, don't kill me off just like that!</font>

260
00:22:01,520 --> 00:22:03,990
<font color="#FFFFFF">Next time: "The Medical Ninja's Student"</font>

